#: ../../source/godot/index.rst:2
msgid "Godot Development"
msgstr "Godot 开发"

#: ../../source/godot/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Daedalus Studio is Godot-first. It can work with project files offline "
"and can connect to a running Godot editor for live editor operations."
msgstr "Daedalus Studio 以 Godot 为首要目标。它可以离线处理项目文件，也可以连接正在运行的 Godot 编辑器，执行实时编辑器操作。"

#: ../../source/godot/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`setup` when the plugin or Godot executable is not configured. "
"Use :doc:`project-work` for guidance on choosing static project tools, "
"editor bridge operations, and verification."
msgstr "插件或 Godot 可执行文件尚未配置时，请使用 :doc:`setup`。有关如何选择静态项目工具、编辑器桥接操作和验证方式，请参阅 :doc:`project-work`。"
